WEBVTT

00:06.640 --> 00:08.040
Action

00:08.440 --> 00:09.840
Move

00:23.120 --> 00:24.920
Ordered to investigate stolen supplies

00:25.200 --> 00:26.360
Those who resist

00:26.520 --> 00:27.960
Will be executed on the spot

00:28.040 --> 00:29.440
Search

00:45.200 --> 00:46.360
A mob

00:46.440 --> 00:48.120
Didn't expect it to be so easy

00:48.240 --> 00:49.440
Don't you think

00:49.600 --> 00:51.160
Things went too smoothly?

00:52.920 --> 00:54.320
Here

00:54.880 --> 00:55.600
Report

00:55.680 --> 00:57.280
No grain found in the warehouse

00:57.360 --> 00:58.760
Only weapons and armor

00:58.960 --> 01:00.360
What?

01:10.920 --> 01:12.320
Report

01:13.240 --> 01:13.880
A unit of elite troops

01:13.960 --> 01:15.360
Is approaching us

01:16.240 --> 01:17.200
Elite troops

01:17.280 --> 01:18.640
Now besides the city defense troops

01:18.720 --> 01:20.120
Where else are there troops?

01:20.200 --> 01:21.320
I see on the banner

01:21.400 --> 01:22.800
The character "Zu"

01:23.640 --> 01:24.920
It's the border army

01:25.000 --> 01:25.960
Oh no

01:26.040 --> 01:27.040
We've been tricked

01:27.120 --> 01:28.520
Go

01:32.400 --> 01:33.200
Rebellious son

01:33.280 --> 01:34.680
This rebellious son

01:35.800 --> 01:37.440
So impatient?

01:38.160 --> 01:39.560
Your Majesty

01:39.720 --> 01:42.440
The capital is now in constant danger

01:42.760 --> 01:43.640
Your subject requests

01:43.720 --> 01:46.720
To immediately deploy border troops to suppress the rebels

01:47.200 --> 01:48.560
Yes

01:48.640 --> 01:50.040
Yes, yes, yes

01:50.240 --> 01:51.960
Zu Kun returned to the capital to report

01:52.120 --> 01:54.040
My border army is nearby

01:54.640 --> 01:56.200
Who's leading them again?

01:56.960 --> 01:58.360
General Fenwei

01:58.520 --> 01:59.920
Zu Yue

02:00.440 --> 02:01.080
Retreat

02:01.160 --> 02:02.560
Retreat, retreat

02:14.400 --> 02:16.067
Prince of Jin has rebelled

02:16.520 --> 02:18.520
I am ordered to capture him

02:18.960 --> 02:20.360
Surrender

02:20.640 --> 02:22.640
And your lives will be spared

02:23.880 --> 02:25.600
I give you three breaths

02:26.160 --> 02:27.560
Drop your weapons

02:29.440 --> 02:30.840
Three

02:34.160 --> 02:35.200
Your Highness

02:35.280 --> 02:37.280
Inside are only armor and weapons

02:37.400 --> 02:38.520
Let's fight our way out

02:38.600 --> 02:39.720
Two
